 -- Serhii Artiushenko <artushenko@protonmail.com>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 13:17:07 +0300

corvo (1.0.0+12) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version scheme fixed at SemVer 2.0.0 with a monotonic build number
    (MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH+BUILD); CMakeLists.txt is the single source of truth and
    scripts/bump-version.sh performs the bump.
  * Support for Qt 6.11: permissions migrated to the QWebEnginePermission API
    (permissionRequested), the deprecated featurePermissionRequested path is kept
    for Qt < 6.8 so Debian 12's Qt 6.4 still builds.
  * Persistent permissions policy set to StoreOnDisk on Qt >= 6.9.
  * User agent is derived from Qt's own instead of being hardcoded: the
    QtWebEngine token is stripped and the real Chromium version kept.
  * Window position is no longer persisted on Wayland, where a client cannot
    position itself - it used to overwrite a valid X11 position with unusable
    coordinates.
  * The web profile is created in main() so it outlives every page, as Qt
    WebEngine requires.
  * Popup windows (window.open) are parented to the main window and a popup that
    never navigates is closed instead of lingering invisibly.
  * Fixed a leak of the tray context menu (QSystemTrayIcon does not take
    ownership).
  * Profile storage/cache paths are applied once instead of on every settings
    change, where Chromium silently ignored them.
  * Geometry writes are throttled, the window position sentinel handles negative
    multi-monitor coordinates, and the unused saveState() blob is gone.
  * CMake warns when a package is built against a Qt outside the distribution,
    which would produce an installable but unstartable .deb.

 -- Serhii Artiushenko <artushenko@protonmail.com>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 13:05:00 +0300

corvo (1.0.0+1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - Qt 6 WebEngine wrapper around web.whatsapp.com.
    - Persistent web profile: the QR code is scanned only once.
    - Automatic camera/microphone permissions for WebRTC calls.
    - System tray with unread badge, freedesktop notifications, autostart.
    - Built-in device diagnostics ("Проверка камеры").

 -- Serhii Artiushenko <artushenko@protonmail.com>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 11:37:11 +0300
